# Testing Gates

## Commands

| Purpose | Command |
|---------|---------|
| Full gate (recommended) | `python scripts/verify_phase_completion.py` |
| Tests only | `pytest` |
| Python lint | `ruff check .` |
| Web lint | `npm run lint` (repo root or `cd web`) |
| Types | `mypy src` |
| Format check (CI-style) | `black --check .` |
| Format apply (local) | `black .` |

Order in verify script: `pytest` → `ruff check .` → `mypy src` → `black --check .` → `npm run lint` (fail-fast). Web lint needs Node/npm and `npm install` in `web/` (or `npm run lint` from repo root after deps are installed).

## Practice

- Prefer narrow test runs first when iterating (`pytest path::test_name`).
- Prefer editing existing tests when behavior changes; new test files require explicit user authorization (see `test-governance.mdc`, AGENTS.md Test Creation Policy).
- Do not delete tests only to save time; slim only if contract coverage stays equivalent.
- Report exact command, pass/fail count, and runtime when claiming results.
- If `black .` modifies files, report format changes separately from "tests passed."

## PR / merge

Before merge: `pip install -e ".[dev]"` then `python scripts/verify_phase_completion.py`, or the same steps manually.

See [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) for completion report requirements.
